var MANUAL = [["1.1.1","Read the image descriptions in the screen reader transcript and confirm each one makes sense."],["1.2.1 to 1.2.5","If the app has any video or audio, confirm captions and transcripts exist."],["1.4.2","If anything plays sound on its own for more than 3 seconds, confirm it can be paused or muted."],["1.4.5","Look for pictures of words, like text inside a banner image. Real text should be used instead."],["2.1.4","Press single letter keys while not in a text box. Nothing should happen unless it can be turned off."],["2.2.2","Anything that moves, scrolls or updates by itself for more than 5 seconds needs a pause button."],["2.3.1","Nothing should flash more than 3 times a second."],["2.4.5","There should be more than one way to find a screen, such as a menu and a search."],["2.4.6","Headings and labels should describe what follows them."],["2.5.1 and 2.5.2","Swipes or pinches need a simple tap or click option, and actions should fire when the click is released, not pressed."],["2.5.7","Anything you drag needs a click alternative, like up and down buttons."],["3.2.1 and 3.2.2","Tabbing into a field or picking a dropdown value should not jump to a new screen on its own."],["3.3.4","Final submits that save money, legal or important data need a review or confirm step."],["3.3.7","Multi step forms should not ask for the same information twice."],["3.3.8","The login should not need a puzzle, and should allow pasting passwords and password managers."]];
